  "_readme": [
    "Maps the current Excel workbook onto the app. Run: npm run import -- \"data/EVENTENUERS 2024.xlsx\" --replace",
    "Slot times below are PLACEHOLDERS: only Royale/Unique have time headers (8:00, 12:00, 16:00, 20:00); the 'between' columns are guessed 2h offsets.",
    "Fix 'slots' (names/times) and 'columns' here, then re-run the import. Prices are left at 0 because the workbook has none.",
    "'promoters': whole-slot holds by these names (or aliases) are imported as promoter bookings. Add more spellings to 'aliases' as needed."
